From eb1565574a7ab64457ae0f6794ad0cb6a8b76726 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Macnak <natsu@google.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 17:20:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 42/42] gfxstream: filter format properties for unsupported NV
 ext

Host drivers supporting VK_NV_linear_color_attachment may return
VK_SUCCESS from vkGetPhysicalDeviceImageFormatProperties(2) for
VK_IMAGE_TILING_LINEAR with VK_IMAGE_USAGE_COLOR_ATTACHMENT_BIT while
setting VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_2_LINEAR_COLOR_ATTACHMENT_BIT_NV instead of
VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_COLOR_ATTACHMENT_BIT in linearTilingFeatures.
Since Gfxstream does not advertise VK_NV_linear_color_attachment to the
guest, mask out VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_2_LINEAR_COLOR_ATTACHMENT_BIT_NV in
getPhysicalDeviceFormatPropertiesCore and return
VK_ERROR_FORMAT_NOT_SUPPORTED in
on_vkGetPhysicalDeviceImageFormatProperties(2) when
VK_IMAGE_TILING_LINEAR and VK_IMAGE_USAGE_COLOR_ATTACHMENT_BIT are
queried without VK_FORMAT_FEATURE_COLOR_ATTACHMENT_BIT in
linearTilingFeatures.

Bug: b/572894253
Flag: EXEMPT bugfix
Test: dEQP-VK.api.info.unsupported_image_usage.linear#color_attachment*
Low-Coverage-Reason: full dEQP with Nvidia GPU not running in CI yet
Change-Id: Ibc0496efffd4c3f83af0d454dfaf7b0533ed2167
(cherry picked from commit 97eea350bca37874526ecda0e7566f35d8861597)

Refs ModAVD/ModAVD#41
